{"2421540": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "白猫骑士物语/ White Cat Knight", "steam_appid": 2421540, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong> Use your wit and courage to uncover the mysteries hidden in every corner </strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The journey to discover the truth is always full of surprises and challenges, especially in the small town of Harstad, which seems to be hiding many untold secrets. Recently, the town's peace has been shattered by a series of unusual events, and all the clues point to those forgotten underground passages. The mayor has sent out a call for heroes, gathering a group of intrepid explorers ready to venture into the dark.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2421540/extras/1e39b70a7d31a23f1b6044a19b858166.poster.avif?t=1786652062\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2421540/extras/1e39b70a7d31a23f1b6044a19b858166.webm?t=1786652062\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2421540/extras/1e39b70a7d31a23f1b6044a19b858166.mp4?t=1786652062\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>White Cat Knight</strong> is a classic 2D action platformer. Run, jump and slash your way through hand-crafted levels, from quiet forests full of hidden treasures to lively little towns and their curious residents.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2421540/extras/339d503b766b21371467948c2f71c929.poster.avif?t=1786652062\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2421540/extras/339d503b766b21371467948c2f71c929.webm?t=1786652062\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2421540/extras/339d503b766b21371467948c2f71c929.mp4?t=1786652062\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Every clue leads you deeper: down to the bottom of an old well, and into the vast, mysterious underground world beneath Harstad. Explore long-buried ancient pathways, uncover the conspiracies behind them, and beware of the dangers lurking in the shadows.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2421540/extras/063bd682167fc4faa6683be2cae3f38a.poster.avif?t=1786652062\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2421540/extras/063bd682167fc4faa6683be2cae3f38a.webm?t=1786652062\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2421540/extras/063bd682167fc4faa6683be2cae3f38a.mp4?t=1786652062\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Game Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Retro charm of side-scrolling jumps:</strong> Classic side-scrolling level design, paired with cartoonish art, takes you back to the golden age of gaming.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Smooth 2D control experience:</strong> Whether it is melee attack, lunge forward or long-range shooting, combined with a rich skill set, let you navigate the dangerous situation.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Adventure in the underground world:</strong> Explore the ancient pathways that have been buried, uncover the conspiracies behind them, and be careful of the crises that lurk in the shadows.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The fun of skill upgrades:</strong> As the game progresses, you will constantly unlock new skills, learn new combat techniques, and increase your strength and speed.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Partner Power:</strong> Together with your friendly partners, defeat those powerful enemies and make your battle journey no longer alone.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2421540/extras/16b7c53238ff748ec06c4cdad9553919.poster.avif?t=1786652062\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2421540/extras/16b7c53238ff748ec06c4cdad9553919.webm?t=1786652062\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2421540/extras/16b7c53238ff748ec06c4cdad9553919.mp4?t=1786652062\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Are you ready? Grab your sword, put on your armor, and let's go on this adventure full of unknowns and surprises!</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong> </strong></h2>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong> Use your wit and courage to uncover the mysteries hidden in every corner </strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The journey to discover the truth is always full of surprises and challenges, especially in the small town of Harstad, which seems to be hiding many untold secrets. Recently, the town's peace has been shattered by a series of unusual events, and all the clues point to those forgotten underground passages. The mayor has sent out a call for heroes, gathering a group of intrepid explorers ready to venture into the dark.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2421540/extras/1e39b70a7d31a23f1b6044a19b858166.poster.avif?t=1786652062\" wid